<title>USA: Valley National in 5 percent div, ups cash.</title>
<headline>Valley National in 5 percent div, ups cash.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valley National Bancorp said Wednesday that its directors have approved a five percent stock dividend payable May 15, to shareholders of record, April 30.</p>
<p>The company also said it is increasing its regular cash dividend to $1.10 annually, from $1.00.</p>
<p>The company said the two actions amounted to an increase in the dividend of 15.5 percent.</p>
